<header><p class="st-kicker">chiefdom · Korea and Japan</p><h1 class="st-title">Usan</h1><p class="st-meta">400 CE – 512 CE (approx.)</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">An island state on Ulleungdo in the East Sea, conquered by Silla in 512 in a famous episode involving wooden lions.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>Usan, centred on the island of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ulleungdo">Ulleungdo</a>, appears only in Korean chronicles. Nothing is known of its founding; its people probably lived by fishing and small-scale farming on the volcanic island.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/samguk-sagi">Samguk sagi</a> describes its inhabitants as fierce and confident in their isolation, but records nothing of its rulers or institutions.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>In 512 the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/silla">Silla</a> general <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/isabu">Isabu</a> sailed to Usan with wooden lions on his ships and threatened to release them unless the islanders surrendered; they submitted and paid annual tribute. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/korea">Korea</a> later cited Usan in claims to nearby islets.</p><p class="st-conf">Few sources survive for this state; details are uncertain.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><figure class="st-fig"><img src="/images/states/usan.jpg" alt="Usan" width="320" height="501"><figcaption>Image: Asieon · CC0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Usan_statelet.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source</a></figcaption></figure><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>400 CE – 512 CE (approx.)</dd><dt>Centuries</dt><dd><a href="/centuries/5th-century">5th century</a> – <a href="/centuries/6th-century">6th century</a></dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>chiefdom</dd><dt>Character</dt><dd>tribal</dd><dt>Today</dt><dd><a href="/countries/south-korea">South Korea</a></dd><dt>Also</dt><dd>Usan-guk, Usanguk</dd></dl><figure class="st-locator"><a href="/atlas?year=456&amp;focus=usan" aria-label="Usan on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="7888 872 640 512" role="img" aria-label="Map: where Usan lay"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-n" d="M826